{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1286","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"E. Fedya the Potter Strikes Back"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Fedya has a string $$$S$$$, initially empty, and an array $$$W$$$, also initially empty."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are $$$n$$$ queries to process, one at a time. Query $$$i$$$ consists of a lowercase English letter $$$c_i$$$ and a nonnegative integer $$$w_i$$$. First, $$$c_i$$$ must be appended to $$$S$$$, and $$$w_i$$$ must be appended to $$$W$$$. The answer to the query is the sum of "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"suspiciousnesses"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" for all subsegments of $$$W$$$ $$$[L, \\ R]$$$, $$$(1 \\leq L \\leq R \\leq i)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We define the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"suspiciousness"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of a subsegment as follows: if the substring of $$$S$$$ corresponding to this subsegment (that is, a string of consecutive characters from $$$L$$$-th to $$$R$$$-th, inclusive) matches the prefix of $$$S$$$ of the same length (that is, a substring corresponding to the subsegment $$$[1, \\ R - L + 1]$$$), then its suspiciousness is equal to the minimum in the array $$$W$$$ on the $$$[L, \\ R]$$$ subsegment. Otherwise, in case the substring does not match the corresponding prefix, the suspiciousness is $$$0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Help Fedya answer all the queries before the orderlies come for him!"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains an integer $$$n$$$ $$$(1 \\leq n \\leq 600\\,000)$$$ — the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The $$$i$$$-th of the following $$$n$$$ lines contains the query $$$i$$$: a lowercase letter of the Latin alphabet $$$c_i$$$ and an integer $$$w_i$$$ $$$(0 \\leq w_i \\leq 2^{30} - 1)$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"All queries are given in an encrypted form. Let $$$ans$$$ be the answer to the previous query (for the first query we set this value equal to $$$0$$$). Then, in order to get the real query, you need to do the following: perform a cyclic shift of $$$c_i$$$ in the alphabet forward by $$$ans$$$, and set $$$w_i$$$ equal to $$$w_i \\oplus (ans \\ \\& \\ MASK)$$$, where $$$\\oplus$$$ is the bitwise exclusive \"or\", $$$\\&$$$ is the bitwise \"and\", and $$$MASK = 2^{30} - 1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print $$$n$$$ lines, $$$i$$$-th line should contain a single integer — the answer to the $$$i$$$-th query."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\na 1\na 0\ny 3\ny 5\nv 4\nu 6\nr 8\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n2\n4\n5\n7\n9\n12\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\na 2\ny 2\nz 0\ny 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n2\n2\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\na 7\nu 5\nt 3\ns 10\ns 11\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\n9\n11\n12\n13\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For convenience, we will call \"suspicious\" those subsegments for which the corresponding lines are prefixes of $$$S$$$, that is, those whose suspiciousness may not be zero."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"As a result of decryption in the first example, after all requests, the string $$$S$$$ is equal to \"abacaba\", and all $$$w_i = 1$$$, that is, the suspiciousness of all suspicious sub-segments is simply equal to $$$1$$$. Let's see how the answer is obtained after each request:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1. $$$S$$$ = \"a\", the array $$$W$$$ has a single subsegment — $$$[1, \\ 1]$$$, and the corresponding substring is \"a\", that is, the entire string $$$S$$$, thus it is a prefix of $$$S$$$, and the suspiciousness of the subsegment is $$$1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2. $$$S$$$ = \"ab\", suspicious subsegments: $$$[1, \\ 1]$$$ and $$$[1, \\ 2]$$$, total $$$2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"3. $$$S$$$ = \"aba\", suspicious subsegments: $$$[1, \\ 1]$$$, $$$[1, \\ 2]$$$, $$$[1, \\ 3]$$$ and $$$[3, \\ 3]$$$, total $$$4$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"4. $$$S$$$ = \"abac\", suspicious subsegments: $$$[1, \\ 1]$$$, $$$[1, \\ 2]$$$, $$$[1, \\ 3]$$$, $$$[1, \\ 4]$$$ and $$$[3, \\ 3]$$$, total $$$5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"5. $$$S$$$ = \"abaca\", suspicious subsegments: $$$[1, \\ 1]$$$, $$$[1, \\ 2]$$$, $$$[1, \\ 3]$$$, $$$[1, \\ 4]$$$ , $$$[1, \\ 5]$$$, $$$[3, \\ 3]$$$ and $$$[5, \\ 5]$$$, total $$$7$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"6. $$$S$$$ = \"abacab\", suspicious subsegments: $$$[1, \\ 1]$$$, $$$[1, \\ 2]$$$, $$$[1, \\ 3]$$$, $$$[1, \\ 4]$$$ , $$$[1, \\ 5]$$$, $$$[1, \\ 6]$$$, $$$[3, \\ 3]$$$, $$$[5, \\ 5]$$$ and $$$[5, \\ 6]$$$, total $$$9$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"7. $$$S$$$ = \"abacaba\", suspicious subsegments: $$$[1, \\ 1]$$$, $$$[1, \\ 2]$$$, $$$[1, \\ 3]$$$, $$$[1, \\ 4]$$$ , $$$[1, \\ 5]$$$, $$$[1, \\ 6]$$$, $$$[1, \\ 7]$$$, $$$[3, \\ 3]$$$, $$$[5, \\ 5]$$$, $$$[5, \\ 6]$$$, $$$[5, \\ 7]$$$ and $$$[7, \\ 7]$$$, total $$$12$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, after all requests $$$S$$$ = \"aaba\", $$$W = [2, 0, 2, 0]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1. $$$S$$$ = \"a\", suspicious subsegments: $$$[1, \\ 1]$$$ (suspiciousness $$$2$$$), totaling $$$2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2. $$$S$$$ = \"aa\", suspicious subsegments: $$$[1, \\ 1]$$$ ($$$2$$$), $$$[1, \\ 2]$$$ ($$$0$$$), $$$[2, \\ 2]$$$ ( $$$0$$$), totaling $$$2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"3. $$$S$$$ = \"aab\", suspicious subsegments: $$$[1, \\ 1]$$$ ($$$2$$$), $$$[1, \\ 2]$$$ ($$$0$$$), $$$[1, \\ 3]$$$ ( $$$0$$$), $$$[2, \\ 2]$$$ ($$$0$$$), totaling $$$2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"4. $$$S$$$ = \"aaba\", suspicious subsegments: $$$[1, \\ 1]$$$ ($$$2$$$), $$$[1, \\ 2]$$$ ($$$0$$$), $$$[1, \\ 3]$$$ ( $$$0$$$), $$$[1, \\ 4]$$$ ($$$0$$$), $$$[2, \\ 2]$$$ ($$$0$$$), $$$[4, \\ 4]$$$ ($$$0$$$), totaling $$$2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third example, from the condition after all requests $$$S$$$ = \"abcde\", $$$W = [7, 2, 10, 1, 7]$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1. $$$S$$$ = \"a\", suspicious subsegments: $$$[1, \\ 1]$$$ ($$$7$$$), totaling $$$7$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"2. $$$S$$$ = \"ab\", suspicious subsegments: $$$[1, \\ 1]$$$ ($$$7$$$), $$$[1, \\ 2]$$$ ($$$2$$$), totaling $$$9$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"3. $$$S$$$ = \"abc\", suspicious subsegments: $$$[1, \\ 1]$$$ ($$$7$$$), $$$[1, \\ 2]$$$ ($$$2$$$), $$$[1, \\ 3]$$$ ( $$$2$$$), totaling $$$11$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"4. $$$S$$$ = \"abcd\", suspicious subsegments: $$$[1, \\ 1]$$$ ($$$7$$$), $$$[1, \\ 2]$$$ ($$$2$$$), $$$[1, \\ 3]$$$ ( $$$2$$$), $$$[1, \\ 4]$$$ ($$$1$$$), totaling $$$12$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"5. $$$S$$$ = \"abcde\", suspicious subsegments: $$$[1, \\ 1]$$$ ($$$7$$$), $$$[1, \\ 2]$$$ ($$$2$$$), $$$[1, \\ 3]$$$ ( $$$2$$$), $$$[1, \\ 4]$$$ ($$$1$$$), $$$[1, \\ 5]$$$ ($$$1$$$), totaling $$$13$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"E","problemCode":"1286E","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1286/problem/E"}